    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Projects</h2>
    <p>Atomdrift is the first open-source platform for AI-based malware detection.
    The tools form a pipeline: stng extracts strings, cleave performs deep static
    analysis, and litmus — the first open-source AI model for malware detection —
    makes threat assessments from cleave's output. All Apache 2.0, written in
    Rust &amp; Go, developed on <a href="https://codeberg.org/atomdrift" target="_blank">Codeberg</a>.
    Released versions are current through 2026-04-10.</p>

